  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいあたりで　５０トンの　せんしゃを\nひっくりかえす　パワー。じぶんが\nたてと　なって　なかまを　まもる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸통박치기로 50톤 전차를\n뒤집는 파워를 지녔다. 자신이\n방패가 되어 동료를 지킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est si puissant qu’il pourrait renverser un char de\n50 t d’un seul assaut. Il se sert de son corps comme\nd’un bouclier pour protéger ses alliés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist so stark, dass es selbst 50 t schwere Panzer\numkippen kann. Es schützt seine Artgenossen,\nindem es sich ihnen als Schild anbietet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su fuerza es tal que, de un empellón, puede hacer\nvolcar un tanque de 50 toneladas. Protege a sus\naliados cuando hace de escudo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Attaccando può rovesciare un carro armato da 50 t.\nProtegge gli alleati facendo loro scudo con il proprio\ncorpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its Tackle is forceful enough to flip a 50-ton tank.\nIt shields its allies from danger with its own body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体当たりで　５０トンの　戦車を\nひっくり返す　パワー。\n自分が　盾となって　仲間を　守る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su fuerza es tal que, de un empellón, puede hacer\nvolcar un tanque de 50 toneladas. Protege a sus\naliados cuando hace de escudo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かおの　まえで　こぶしを　あわせて\nぼうぎょの　ポーズを　とると\nばくだんの　ちょくげきも　たえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "얼굴 앞에 주먹을 맞대어\n방어 포즈를 취하면\n폭탄의 직격도 견뎌낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se défend en joignant ses poings devant son visage.\nDans cette posture, il peut même résister à l’onde de\nchoc d’une explosion.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn es seine Fäuste vors Gesicht hält und so eine\nVerteidigungshaltung einnimmt, kann es selbst eine\nExplosion überstehen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando adopta una postura defensiva juntando\nambos puños delante de la cara, es capaz de\nresistir incluso el impacto directo de una bomba.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In posizione difensiva, con i pugni in guardia, è in\ngrado di resistere persino a un’esplosione diretta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
